# Generated artifacts (ros2_ws/src/cart_pole_gz_train/) - the world SDF and
# intermediate URDF are regenerated from the xacro on every run, and the
# policy/normalization stats are training output. None should be committed:
# a checked-in cart_pole_train.sdf in particular would be a second, silently
# drifting source of truth for the robot's physical parameters.
